    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You treat all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons\" title=\"Exotic Weapons\">Exotic Weapons</a> as a single weapon group. If you already have <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Talents\" title=\"Talents\">Talents</a> that grant you proficiency with, or augment the use of, one <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon\">Exotic Weapon</a>, those <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a> now apply to all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons\" title=\"Exotic Weapons\">Exotic Weapons</a>. For example, if you already had <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapon_Proficiency_(Shyarn)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Shyarn)\">Exotic Weapon Proficiency (Shyarn)</a>, and <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus_(Shyarn)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon Focus (Shyarn)\">Weapon Focus (Shyarn)</a>, you are now proficient with, and possess the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Weapon_Focus\" title=\"Weapon Focus\">Weapon Focus</a> Feat for, all <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Exotic_Weapons\" title=\"Exotic Weapons\">Exotic Weapons</a>.",
